# Pinned release tools (Linux x86_64 runners and sessions). One line per tool, whitespace-separated:
#   name  version  url  sha256-of-the-archive  path-of-the-binary-inside-the-archive
# The hash is checked before anything is unpacked; scripts/release/install-tool.sh does the install.
# To bump a tool: change the version and URL, download the archive, `sha256sum` it, and say in the
# PR where the hash was read (actionlint publishes a checksums file; cargo-deny does not).
